<title>NETHERLANDS: DICO 1996 FIRST-HALF PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>DICO 1996 FIRST-HALF PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>UDEN, Netherlands 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.3  vs   0.2</p>
<p>    Turnover				46.8  vs  50.0</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     0.8  vs   0.9</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.1  vs   0.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Beds and furniture maker NV DICO International said</p>
<p>in March it expected its markets to remain weak but added it</p>
<p>could not give a full-year forecast.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
